# The build context is Helpers/; BuildKit reads this file because it sits next to the Dockerfile
# (a .dockerignore in PluckReview/ would be ignored). Only what the Dockerfile copies goes in.
*
!PluckReview/Cargo.toml
!PluckReview/Cargo.lock
!PluckReview/src
!PluckIroh/Cargo.toml
!PluckIroh/Cargo.lock
!PluckIroh/src
